--- !u!114 &1887391713
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1887391711}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\n\nChapter 3  \"The Fox\"\r\n\n\r\n\"Go. I\u2019ll give you five minutes.
    Just five minutes of chasing it, then we go back\"\n\r\nJames knew that Maddie
    would probably be in a bad mood for the rest of the day if she didn\u2019t get
    her way, so he reluctantly agreed. Forgetting the pain in her knee, Maddie happily
    headed in the direction of the fox.\r\n\n\nOnce again, they left the stone-paved
    steps and followed an unmaintained dirt path. The smell of earth and grass suddenly
    became stronger. The light from Maddie\u2019s phone was not enough, so James
    and Liam also turned on their phone lights to watch their footing. \n\nThey had
    thought that even if they followed the fox, they would probably lose sight of
    it soon and Maddie would eventually give up, but the fox slowly walked deeper
    into the darkening forest, almost as if it were deliberately making the three
    of them follow.\r\n\n\"We\u2019re getting farther and farther away from the torii.
    We should go back soon\"\r\nAfter walking for a while, Liam said hesitantly.
    He was right. Everything ahead and behind them was pitch black, and the torii
    were no longer visible.\r\n\r\n\"Yeah, let\u2019s go back\"\r\n\r\nThe moment
    Maddie said this, the fox stopped and turned around. Its eyes emitted a red glow,
    and its entire body radiated something so strange that it made the fur on their
    bodies stand on end. At that moment, James felt the violent pressure of something
    invisible taking over his body, accompanied by a pain so intense that it felt
    as though all four of his limbs were being torn apart. In his ears, he heard
    hundreds, perhaps thousands, of voices that sounded like cats. James let out
    a scream and collapsed to the ground.\r\n\r\n\"James, James!!\"\r\n\r\nMaddie
    and Liam crouched down and shook James, but there was no response.\r\n\r\n\"It\u2019s\u2026
    coming this way\"\r\n\r\nLiam\u2019s legs gave way, and he collapsed onto the
    ground. The fox lowered its head and approached them without taking its eyes
    off them. Its red eyes opened wide, its face taking on a terrifying expression
    that was nothing like an ordinary fox.\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\r\n\"M-monster!\"\r\n\r\nMaddie
    took several steps backward, but tripped over a stone sticking out of the ground
    and fell.\r\n\r\n\"Maddie!\"\r\n\r\nLiam grabbed James by the arm and dragged
    him toward Maddie. But the fox growled, grabbed James by the leg, and began pulling
    him in the opposite direction. It was incredibly strong. Liam pulled with all
    his strength, refusing to let go of James\u2019s arm. James\u2019s body stretched,
    and the sound of a joint popping out echoed through the darkness. The fox dug
    its four paws into the ground and tore James away from Liam before beginning
    to attack him with its sharp fangs.\r\n\r\n\"Stop!\"\r\n\r\nLiam crawled forward
    and threw himself over James\u2019s body, shielding him from the fox. As the
    sound of its teeth snapping together echoed through the forest, Liam repeatedly
    kicked the fox away.\r\n\r\n\"Maddie, anything will do, a stick or a rock, just
    throw it!\"\r\n\r\nLiam shouted desperately. Maddie picked up a nearby branch
    and charged toward the fox, swinging it wildly while screaming \"Uwaaaah\". By
    chance, the end of the branch struck the fox directly in the eye. The fox let
    out a shriek and opened its mouth wide. Several rows of sharp teeth, almost like
    a shark\u2019s, were exposed. Then Maddie heard a voice coming from somewhere.\r\n\r\n[Koitsura
    wa ningen da, akuryou de wanai. Sa, kyou wa kaeshite yare]\r\n\r\n\"W-who is
    this?\"\r\n\r\nThe voice was speaking Japanese. But Maddie, who was unfamiliar
    with the language, could not understand what it was saying. However, the fox
    pulled its teeth back into its mouth, paused for a moment, and then spat something
    resembling water at the three of them. When the icy, water-like substance struck
    their bodies, both Liam and Maddie suddenly lost their vision and collapsed where
    they stood.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen Maddie lifted herself up, the three of them were
    lying at an intersection near the shrine station. Liam and James also slowly
    got up, holding their heads.\r\n\r\n\"James, are you okay?\"\r\n\r\nMaddie looked
    at James with concern, but there wasn't a single injury on him. Even though he
    had been bitten and scratched so badly\u2026\r\n\r\n\"Yeah, did something happen?\"\r\n\r\nHearing
    this, Maddie and Liam looked at each other.\r\n\r\nThen Maddie looked down at
    her hand.\r\n\r\nA small fox-mask netsuke was resting in her palm.\r\n\n"
